-- examples/checks/agg-member-derivs-retract-check.rofl — agg_member_derivs_retract:
-- the cells of agg-member-derivs.rofl after md_chan(2, y), md_chan(3, x) and
-- md_chan(1, x) are retracted, one by one, as a world that never had them:
--   md_chan(2, y)  an alternative of sale 2: the member stays and loses one `alt`
--   md_chan(3, x)  the canonical derivation of sale 3: its other one is canonical now
--   md_chan(1, x)  the only derivation of sale 1: the member goes, a's count 2 -> 1, its sum 15 -> 5,
--                  and a is left with one member, so no quorum of two
-- The md_d* cells read md_chan itself, so the retraction is a delta on them;
-- the md_* cells read md_ok and are read again whole. A member keeps its id.
-- expect-row: cell $cell(r71cb3651,2,0,$cons(a,$nil)) median = 5 h=1 tick=0 sealed=[md_sale@0, md_chan@0] alg=holistic use=recompute
-- expect-row: mem $cell(r71cb3651,2,0,$cons(a,$nil)) #1 id=a58a6e49fc95c4d2 (5,2) h=1 [fact:md_chan[main](2,w); fact:md_sale[main](2,a,5)] alt [fact:md_chan[main](2,x); fact:md_sale[main](2,a,5)]
-- expect-row: cell $cell(r71cb3651,2,0,$cons(b,$nil)) median = 7 h=1 tick=0 sealed=[md_sale@0, md_chan@0] alg=holistic use=recompute
-- expect-row: mem $cell(r71cb3651,2,0,$cons(b,$nil)) #1 id=b793cd9186439be8 (7,3) h=1 [fact:md_chan[main](3,y); fact:md_sale[main](3,b,7)]
-- expect-row: mem $cell(r71cb3651,2,0,$cons(b,$nil)) #2 id=b797359186468277 (7,4) h=1 [fact:md_chan[main](4,x); fact:md_sale[main](4,b,7)]
-- expect-row: cell $cell(ra4efae18,2,0,$cons(a,$nil)) median = 5 h=2 tick=0 sealed=[md_sale@0, md_ok@1] alg=holistic use=recompute
-- expect-row: mem $cell(ra4efae18,2,0,$cons(a,$nil)) #1 id=1719ab6c050214dd (5,2) h=2 [fact:md_ok[main](2,w); fact:md_sale[main](2,a,5)] alt [fact:md_ok[main](2,x); fact:md_sale[main](2,a,5)] alt [fact:md_ok[main](2,z); fact:md_sale[main](2,a,5)]
-- expect-row: cell $cell(ra4efae18,2,0,$cons(b,$nil)) median = 7 h=2 tick=0 sealed=[md_sale@0, md_ok@1] alg=holistic use=recompute
-- expect-row: mem $cell(ra4efae18,2,0,$cons(b,$nil)) #1 id=0be71732f09a6503 (7,3) h=2 [fact:md_ok[main](3,y); fact:md_sale[main](3,b,7)]
-- expect-row: mem $cell(ra4efae18,2,0,$cons(b,$nil)) #2 id=0bfe9f32f0ae2afc (7,4) h=2 [fact:md_ok[main](4,x); fact:md_sale[main](4,b,7)]
-- expect-row: cell $cell(raf083c42,2,0,$cons(a,$nil)) sum = 5 h=2 tick=0 sealed=[md_sale@0, md_ok@1] alg=invertible use=subtract
-- expect-row: mem $cell(raf083c42,2,0,$cons(a,$nil)) #1 id=1cf4e0406a2d9323 (5,2) h=2 [fact:md_ok[main](2,w); fact:md_sale[main](2,a,5)] alt [fact:md_ok[main](2,x); fact:md_sale[main](2,a,5)] alt [fact:md_ok[main](2,z); fact:md_sale[main](2,a,5)]
-- expect-row: cell $cell(raf083c42,2,0,$cons(b,$nil)) sum = 14 h=2 tick=0 sealed=[md_sale@0, md_ok@1] alg=invertible use=subtract
-- expect-row: mem $cell(raf083c42,2,0,$cons(b,$nil)) #1 id=b07be125fe6c15e9 (7,3) h=2 [fact:md_ok[main](3,y); fact:md_sale[main](3,b,7)]
