-- expect-row: mem $cell(re326df8e,2,0,$cons(b,$cons(2,$nil))) #1 id=2f88df37f1afbd16 (3) h=1 [fact:md_chan[main](3,y); fact:md_sale[main](3,b,7)]
-- expect-row: mem $cell(re326df8e,2,0,$cons(b,$cons(2,$nil))) #2 id=2f99df37f1be3049 (4) h=1 [fact:md_chan[main](4,x); fact:md_sale[main](4,b,7)]
